#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/troubleshooting/ascend_910b_operators.rst:14
msgid ""
"Native vLLM starts and chats successfully, but the same model launched through "
"Xinference fails with a recurrent-state dtype error."
msgstr "原生 vLLM 可以成功啟動並對話，但透過 Xinference 啟動同一模型時，出現迴圈狀態的 dtype 錯誤。"

#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/troubleshooting/ascend_910b_operators.rst:22
msgid "Evidence and diagnosis"
msgstr "證據與診斷"

#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/troubleshooting/ascend_910b_operators.rst
msgid "Observed"
msgstr "已觀察到"

#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/troubleshooting/ascend_910b_operators.rst:26
msgid ""
"The recorded Xinference-launched process did not inherit the custom operator paths "
"that were present in the working native vLLM environment."
msgstr "記錄中由 Xinference 啟動的程序，沒有繼承正常執行的原生 vLLM 環境中的自定義運算元路徑。"

#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/troubleshooting/ascend_910b_operators.rst
msgid "Diagnosis"
msgstr "診斷"

#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/troubleshooting/ascend_910b_operators.rst:27
msgid ""
"The missing custom GDN/Mamba operator environment caused a fallback to the built-in "
"CANN operator, which rejected the model's float32 state in this case."
msgstr "自定義 GDN/Mamba 運算元環境缺失，導致回退至內建 CANN 運算元；在本案例中，該運算元拒絕模型的 float32 狀態。"

#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/troubleshooting/ascend_910b_operators.rst:29
msgid ""
"Check both ``ASCEND_CUSTOM_OPP_PATH`` and the custom ``op_api/lib`` entry in "
"``LD_LIBRARY_PATH`` before changing model precision."
msgstr ""
"調整模型精度前，先檢查  ``ASCEND_CUSTOM_OPP_PATH`` ，以及  ``LD_LIBRARY_PATH``  中自定義的  "
"``op_api/lib``  路徑。"

#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/troubleshooting/ascend_910b_operators.rst:32
msgid "Load the operator environment"
msgstr "載入運算元環境"

#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/troubleshooting/ascend_910b_operators.rst:34
msgid ""
"Source the vLLM-Ascend custom environment in the same shell that starts Xinference. "
"Adjust the installation path for your image."
msgstr "在啟動 Xinference 的同一個 shell 中載入 vLLM-Ascend 自定義環境指令碼，並按映象調整安裝路徑。"

#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/troubleshooting/ascend_910b_operators.rst:42
msgid ""
"Align model parameters with the working native launch. These are the values from the "
"original test, not defaults for every deployment."
msgstr "將模型引數與能夠正常執行的原生啟動配置對齊。以下數值來自原始測試，並非適用於所有部署的預設值。"

#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/troubleshooting/ascend_910b_operators.rst:44
msgid "Parameters from the recorded deployment"
msgstr "部署記錄中的引數"

#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/troubleshooting/ascend_910b_operators.rst:57
msgid "Verification"
msgstr "驗證"

#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/troubleshooting/ascend_910b_operators.rst:59
msgid ""
"Launch through Xinference again, inspect the inherited operator environment and "
"confirm that the dtype error is gone and chat output is coherent. Record CANN, torch-"
"npu, vLLM and vLLM-Ascend versions alongside the image tag."
msgstr ""
"再次透過 Xinference 啟動模型，檢查程序繼承的運算元環境，確認 dtype 錯誤消失且對話輸出連貫。同時記錄映象標籤及 CANN、torch-npu、vLLM"
"、vLLM-Ascend 版本。"

